<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-20438] Support TPU Direct Storage (TDS) via PCI P2P DMA</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20438</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;We need to support TPU Direct Storage (TDS) with Peer-to-Peer (P2P) RDMA in Lustre. This will cover changes from LNet to LLite to enable direct data transfer between Lustre and TPU memory.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Note that this work will not update or affect the existing support for GPUDirect Storage (GDS).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
